		background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--tc) 85%, #fff), color-mix(in srgb, var(--tc) 70%, #000)); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / .12), 0 10px 30px color-mix(in srgb, var(--tc) 35%, transparent); transition: box-shadow .25s; }
